and Aramaic) weighty, influential , יָקָר מֵחָכְמָה Eccl 10:1 weightier than wisdom and honour is a little folly. — In Prov 17:27 read Kt וְקַררֿוּחַ and one cool of spirit (see VB ); in Zech 14:6 read לֹא יִהְיֶה אוֺר וְקָרוֺת וְקִפָּאוֺן there shall not be light but cold and congelation (see id. and Vrss. ); ** ' but ' is very dubious; read probably חוֺם וְקָרוֺת there shall be neither heat nor cold , etc. (We and others).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3699')\">BDB3699</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3368')\">H3368</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3698')\">BDB3698</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3700')\">BDB3700</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יָקָר</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>precious, rare, splendid, weighty</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>יָקָר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,1)\">1Sam 3:1</ref> + 9 t.; construct <bdbheb>יְקַרֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,27)\">Prov 17:27</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>וקר</bdbheb>; see below); <bdbheb>כִּיקַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 37:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,20)\">Ps 37:20</ref> feminine <bdbheb>יְקָרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,30)\">2Sam 12:30</ref> + 14 t.; construct <bdbheb>יִקְרַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref> masculine plural <bdbheb>יְקָרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,2)\">Lam 4:2</ref> feminine plural <bdbheb>יְקָדוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1