=\"27\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,27)\">Prov 12:27</ref> <bdbheb>הוֺן יָקָר וְנָעִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 24:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,1)\">Prov 24:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>precious, highly valued:</highlight> <bdbheb>נֶפֶשׁ יְקָרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,26)\">Prov 6:26</ref> <highlight>precious life</highlight>; opposed to <bdbheb>זוֺלֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 15:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,19)\">Jer 15:19</ref> (of choice elements of character); <bdbheb>הַמָּֽוְתָה לַחֲסִידָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָקָר בְּעֵינֵי י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 116:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,15)\">Ps 116:15</ref> <bdbheb>יְקָרָה הִיא מפניים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 3:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,15)\">Prov 3:15</ref> <highlight>she</highlight> (wisdom) <highlight>is more precious than rubies</highlight> (see also <b>c</b>); <highlight>prized</highlight>, of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חסד י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 36:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,8)\">Ps 36:8</ref> = substantive <bdbheb>בְּנוֺת מְלָכִים בְּיִקְּרותֶ֑יךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,10)\">Ps 45:10</ref> <highlight>king's daughters are among thy precious</highlight> ( = <highlight>dear</highlight>) <highlight>ones.</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>אֶבֶן יְקָרָה</bdbheb> collective <highlight>precious stones, jewels</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,30)\">2Sam 12:30</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 20:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"20\" vB